const productRows = {"Choose the exact network before sending. USDT is supported here on BNB Smart Chain (BEP-20) and TRON (TRC-20). Bitcoin accepts BTC only, not USDT. Deposit requests are reviewed manually and this form does not transfer funds.": ["Choose the exact network before sending. USDT is supported here on BNB Smart Chain (BEP-20) and TRON (TRC-20). Bitcoin accepts BTC only, not USDT. Deposit requests are reviewed manually and this form does not transfer funds.", "Choisissez le bon réseau avant tout envoi. USDT est accepté sur BNB Smart Chain (BEP-20) et TRON (TRC-20). Bitcoin accepte uniquement BTC, pas USDT. Les demandes de dépôt sont examinées manuellement et ce formulaire ne transfère aucun fonds.", "Elige la red exacta antes de enviar. Aquí se admite USDT en BNB Smart Chain (BEP-20) y TRON (TRC-20). Bitcoin solo acepta BTC, no USDT. Los depósitos se revisan manualmente y este formulario no transfiere fondos.", "Wähle vor dem Senden das richtige Netzwerk. USDT wird hier auf BNB Smart Chain (BEP-20) und TRON (TRC-20) unterstützt. Bitcoin akzeptiert nur BTC, kein USDT. Einzahlungen werden manuell geprüft; dieses Formular überträgt kein Geld.", "Escolha a rede correta antes de enviar. USDT é aceite aqui na BNB Smart Chain (BEP-20) e na TRON (TRC-20). Bitcoin aceita apenas BTC, não USDT. Os depósitos são analisados manualmente e este formulário não transfere fundos.", "भेजने से पहले सही नेटवर्क चुनें। यहाँ USDT, BNB Smart Chain (BEP-20) और TRON (TRC-20) पर समर्थित है। Bitcoin पर केवल BTC स्वीकार्य है, USDT नहीं। जमा मैन्युअल रूप से जाँचे जाते हैं; यह फ़ॉर्म धन ट्रांसफर नहीं करता।", "发送前请确认网络。此处支持通过 BNB Smart Chain (BEP-20) 和 TRON (TRC-20) 存入 USDT。Bitcoin 网络仅支持 BTC，不支持 USDT。存款请求需人工审核，此表单不会转移资金。", "Scegli la rete esatta prima di inviare. USDT è supportato su BNB Smart Chain (BEP-20) e TRON (TRC-20). Bitcoin accetta solo BTC, non USDT. I depositi vengono verificati manualmente e questo modulo non trasferisce fondi."], "Address not available.": ["Address not available.", "Adresse non disponible.", "Dirección no disponible.", "Adresse nicht verfügbar.", "Endereço indisponível.", "पता उपलब्ध नहीं है।", "地址不可用。", "Indirizzo non disponibile."], "Operator verified": ["Operator verified", "Vérifié par l’opérateur", "Verificado por el operador", "Vom Betreiber geprüft", "Verificado pelo operador", "ऑपरेटर द्वारा सत्यापित", "运营方已验证", "Verificato dall’operatore"], "· Verify the address and network independently before sending. This label does not prove address ownership or an on-chain transaction.": ["· Verify the address and network independently before sending. This label does not prove address ownership or an on-chain transaction.", "· Vérifiez vous-même l’adresse et le réseau avant tout envoi. Cette mention ne prouve ni la propriété de l’adresse ni une transaction sur la blockchain.", "· Verifica la dirección y la red por tu cuenta antes de enviar. Esta etiqueta no demuestra la titularidad ni una transacción en cadena.", "· Prüfe Adresse und Netzwerk vor dem Senden selbst. Dieser Hinweis belegt weder den Besitz der Adresse noch eine On-Chain-Transaktion.", "· Verifique de forma independente o endereço e a rede antes de enviar. Esta indicação não comprova a titularidade nem uma transação na blockchain.", "· भेजने से पहले पते और नेटवर्क की स्वतंत्र रूप से जाँच करें। यह लेबल पते का स्वामित्व या ऑन-चेन लेनदेन सिद्ध नहीं करता।", "· 发送前请自行核实地址和网络。此标记不证明地址所有权或链上交易。", "· Verifica autonomamente indirizzo e rete prima di inviare. Questa dicitura non prova la proprietà dell’indirizzo né una transazione on-chain."], "Bitcoin network selected: send BTC only. Do not send USDT to this address.": ["Bitcoin network selected: send BTC only. Do not send USDT to this address.", "Réseau Bitcoin sélectionné : envoyez uniquement du BTC. N’envoyez pas d’USDT à cette adresse.", "Red Bitcoin seleccionada: envía solo BTC. No envíes USDT a esta dirección.", "Bitcoin-Netzwerk ausgewählt: Sende nur BTC. Sende kein USDT an diese Adresse.", "Rede Bitcoin selecionada: envie apenas BTC. Não envie USDT para este endereço.", "Bitcoin नेटवर्क चुना गया है: केवल BTC भेजें। इस पते पर USDT न भेजें।", "已选择 Bitcoin 网络：仅发送 BTC。请勿向此地址发送 USDT。", "Rete Bitcoin selezionata: invia solo BTC. Non inviare USDT a questo indirizzo."], "Amount (USD equivalent)": ["Amount (USD equivalent)", "Montant (équivalent USD)", "Importe (equivalente en USD)", "Betrag (USD-Gegenwert)", "Montante (equivalente em USD)", "राशि (USD के बराबर)", "金额（美元等值）", "Importo (equivalente in USD)"], "WITHDRAWAL REQUEST": ["WITHDRAWAL REQUEST", "DEMANDE DE RETRAIT", "SOLICITUD DE RETIRO", "AUSZAHLUNGSANTRAG", "PEDIDO DE LEVANTAMENTO", "निकासी अनुरोध", "取款申请", "RICHIESTA DI PRELIEVO"], "Balance": ["Balance", "Solde", "Saldo", "Guthaben", "Saldo", "शेष", "余额", "Saldo"], "Requests are reviewed manually; this form does not send funds.": ["Requests are reviewed manually; this form does not send funds.", "Les demandes sont examinées manuellement ; ce formulaire n’envoie pas de fonds.", "Las solicitudes se revisan manualmente; este formulario no envía fondos.", "Anträge werden manuell geprüft; dieses Formular sendet kein Geld.", "Os pedidos são analisados manualmente; este formulário não envia fundos.", "अनुरोधों की मैन्युअल समीक्षा होती है; यह फ़ॉर्म धन नहीं भेजता।", "请求需人工审核；此表单不会发送资金。", "Le richieste sono esaminate manualmente; questo modulo non invia fondi."], "BNB Chain · BEP-20": ["BNB Chain · BEP-20", "BNB Chain · BEP-20", "BNB Chain · BEP-20", "BNB Chain · BEP-20", "BNB Chain · BEP-20", "BNB Chain · BEP-20", "BNB Chain · BEP-20", "BNB Chain · BEP-20"], "TRON · TRC-20": ["TRON · TRC-20", "TRON · TRC-20", "TRON · TRC-20", "TRON · TRC-20", "TRON · TRC-20", "TRON · TRC-20", "TRON · TRC-20", "TRON · TRC-20"], "Submit withdrawal request": ["Submit withdrawal request", "Envoyer la demande de retrait", "Enviar solicitud de retiro", "Auszahlungsantrag senden", "Enviar pedido de levantamento", "निकासी अनुरोध भेजें", "提交取款申请", "Invia richiesta di prelievo"], "Submitting a request does not send a payout or transfer funds.": ["Submitting a request does not send a payout or transfer funds.", "L’envoi d’une demande ne déclenche aucun paiement ni transfert de fonds.", "Enviar una solicitud no realiza ningún pago ni transfiere fondos.", "Das Absenden eines Antrags löst keine Auszahlung oder Überweisung aus.", "O envio do pedido não efetua um pagamento nem transfere fundos.", "अनुरोध भेजने से भुगतान या धन ट्रांसफर नहीं होता।", "提交请求不会发放款项或转移资金。", "L’invio di una richiesta non effettua pagamenti né trasferisce fondi."], "Conservative · 8% stop": ["Conservative · 8% stop", "Prudent · stop à 8 %", "Conservador · stop del 8 %", "Konservativ · 8-%-Stop", "Conservador · stop de 8%", "कंज़र्वेटिव · 8% स्टॉप", "保守型 · 8% 止损", "Prudente · stop all’8%"], "Balanced · 18% stop": ["Balanced · 18% stop", "Équilibré · stop à 18 %", "Equilibrado · stop del 18 %", "Ausgewogen · 18-%-Stop", "Equilibrado · stop de 18%", "बैलेंस्ड · 18% स्टॉप", "平衡型 · 18% 止损", "Bilanciato · stop al 18%"], "Aggressive · 35% stop": ["Aggressive · 35% stop", "Dynamique · stop à 35 %", "Agresivo · stop del 35 %", "Risikoreich · 35-%-Stop", "Agressivo · stop de 35%", "एग्रेसिव · 35% स्टॉप", "激进型 · 35% 止损", "Aggressivo · stop al 35%"], "Stop handling": ["Stop handling", "Gestion du stop", "Gestión del stop", "Stop-Verhalten", "Gestão do stop", "स्टॉप प्रबंधन", "止损处理", "Gestione dello stop"], "Confirm plan": ["Confirm plan", "Confirmer le plan", "Confirmar plan", "Plan bestätigen", "Confirmar plano", "योजना की पुष्टि करें", "确认计划", "Conferma piano"], "INVESTMENT": ["INVESTMENT", "INVESTISSEMENT", "INVERSIÓN", "ANLAGE", "INVESTIMENTO", "निवेश", "投资", "INVESTIMENTO"], "ACTIVE PLAN": ["ACTIVE PLAN", "PLAN ACTIF", "PLAN ACTIVO", "AKTIVER PLAN", "PLANO ATIVO", "सक्रिय योजना", "进行中的计划", "PIANO ATTIVO"], "PLAN DETAILS": ["PLAN DETAILS", "DÉTAILS DU PLAN", "DETALLES DEL PLAN", "PLANDETAILS", "DETALHES DO PLANO", "योजना विवरण", "计划详情", "DETTAGLI DEL PIANO"], "Investment plan": ["Investment plan", "Plan d’investissement", "Plan de inversión", "Anlageplan", "Plano de investimento", "निवेश योजना", "投资计划", "Piano d’investimento"], "Plan trend": ["Plan trend", "Tendance du plan", "Tendencia del plan", "Plantrend", "Tendência do plano", "योजना रुझान", "计划趋势", "Andamento del piano"], "Index · 100 start": ["Index · 100 start", "Indice · base 100", "Índice · base 100", "Index · Start bei 100", "Índice · base 100", "सूचकांक · शुरुआत 100", "指数 · 起始值 100", "Indice · base 100"], "All": ["All", "Tout", "Todo", "Alle", "Tudo", "सभी", "全部", "Tutti"], "Asset weights": ["Asset weights", "Pondération des actifs", "Pesos de activos", "Vermögensgewichtung", "Pesos dos ativos", "एसेट वेट", "资产权重", "Pesi degli asset"], "Asset chart": ["Asset chart", "Graphique de l’actif", "Gráfico del activo", "Asset-Chart", "Gráfico do ativo", "एसेट चार्ट", "资产图表", "Grafico dell’asset"]};
